{
  "family": "wall_type",
  "_comment": "Every key WallTypeLoader.load reads (GsonHelper / optionalRL literals). Kept in step by FieldContractReflectionGuardTest.",
  "_why": "culture and gateway_plan_set are read without a default: absent, the load throws and the wall type is not registered — the village then raises no wall and says nothing. Everything else is defaulted, so a typo there silently restores the default (a misspelled walls_between_towers is 3, a misspelled tower_spawn is true).",
